  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mi>b</mi></math>&nbsp;be two non-zero real numbers. Then the number of elements in the set&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>Re</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>and</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Re</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to</p>"
  },
